# LF everywhere, on every platform (Windows clones otherwise get CRLF, which breaks byte-exact
# checks such as the generated CONFIGURATION.md and the .gitignore parsing in the secret scan).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Batch files keep their CRLF bytes as committed (no conversion), so ZIP downloads get CRLF too.
*.cmd -text
*.png binary
*.sqlite binary
